Job portal CLIs in this directory are copied from
https://github.com/MadsLorentzen/ai-job-search (MIT License, 2026 Mads Lorentzen).

linkedin-search uses LinkedIn's public jobs-guest pages. Automated access is against
LinkedIn's Terms of Service; keep volume low and personal-use only.

The four Danish portals (jobbank, jobdanmark, jobindex, jobnet) search Denmark.
linkedin-search and freehire-search are country-agnostic.

Install (Linux/macOS), from the repo root, after Bun is on PATH:

  for tool in jobbank-search jobdanmark-search jobindex-search jobnet-search linkedin-search freehire-search; do
    (cd ".agents/skills/$tool/cli" && bun install)
  done

linkedin-search and freehire-search have zero runtime dependencies; bun install only
pulls TypeScript types. The Danish CLIs need bun install for @bunli/core, zod, and
node-html-parser.
